This licence covers the SOURCE CODE of this repository only. It does not grant
any rights over the datasets, knowledge bases or pre-trained models the code
downloads or consumes. Each of those carries its own licence and citation
requirements, documented in src/data/sources.py and in the README:

  * FigLang 2020 Shared Task data  -- Ghosh, Vajpayee & Muresan (2020)
  * MUStARD                        -- Castro et al. (2019), MIT
