  * SARC                           -- Khodak, Saunshi & Vodrahalli (2018)
  * ConceptNet 5.7                 -- Speer, Chin & Havasi (2017), CC BY-SA 4.0
  * ATOMIC / COMET                 -- Sap et al. (2019); Hwang et al. (2021)
